<figure id="S6.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE III: </span>Summary of per-class textual descriptions used in prompt design. This table presents representative examples selected from the full set of 55 action classes in the dataset.
<span id="S6.T3.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">(H): Hierarchical</span> – Red sentences are generated using the hierarchical strategy,
<span id="S6.T3.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;">(S): Semantic</span> – Green sentences are generated using the semantic strategy, and
<span id="S6.T3.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0080FF;">(D): Discriminative</span> – Blue sentences are generated using the discriminative strategy.
The complete set of descriptions is available at <a href="https://etri3ddescription.vercel.app/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://etri3ddescription.vercel.app/</a>.
</figcaption>
